{
  "meta": {
    "source": "LoA-LFBB-LFMM_EN v7.1 (22/04/2026)",
    "scope": "Interface Bordeaux ACC (LFBB) <-> Marseille ACC (LFMM). Sections 2.2, 2.3, 3.1, 3.2.1 a 3.2.12.",
    "notScoped": "Section 2.1 (classification d'espace) non encodee. LoA internes a chaque FIR non couvertes.",
    "disclaimer": "FOR SIMULATION USE ONLY - NOT VALID FOR REAL OPERATIONS"
  },

  "stations": {
    "LFBB_CTR":  { "freq": "130.230", "name": "Bordeaux Control",    "fallback": [] },
    "LFBB_N_CTR":{ "freq": "134.255", "name": "Bordeaux North",      "fallback": ["LFBB_CTR"] },
    "LFBB_S_CTR":{ "freq": "126.130", "name": "Bordeaux South",      "fallback": ["LFBB_CTR"] },
    "LFBO_APP":  { "freq": "129.305", "name": "Toulouse Approach",   "fallback": ["LFBB_S_CTR", "LFBB_CTR"] },
    "LFBL_APP":  { "freq": "118.080", "name": "Limoges Approach",    "fallback": ["LFBB_N_CTR", "LFBB_CTR"] },
    "LFBD_APP":  { "freq": "129.875", "name": "Aquitaine Approach",  "fallback": ["LFBB_CTR"],
                   "note": "Rattachement N/S non defini par la LoA (2.2.1) : fallback direct sur LFBB_CTR" },
    "LFMM_CTR":  { "freq": "128.850", "name": "Marseille Control",   "fallback": [] },
    "LFMM_W_CTR":{ "freq": "132.365", "name": "Marseille West",      "fallback": ["LFMM_CTR"] },
    "LFLC_APP":  { "freq": "122.225", "name": "Clermont Approach",   "fallback": ["LFMM_W_CTR", "LFMM_CTR"] },
    "LFMT_APP":  { "freq": "131.055", "name": "Montpellier Approach","fallback": ["LFMM_W_CTR", "LFMM_CTR"] }
  },

  "groups": {
    "LSGG_TMA": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN"],
    "LSAG_CTA": ["LSGC", "LSGS", "LSGK", "LSMP"],
    "BARCELONA_GROUP": ["LEBL", "LEDA", "LEGE", "LERS", "LELL"]
  },

  "defaults": {
    "accToApp": {
      "level": { "fl": 150, "trend": "descending" },
      "note": "Arrivees LFBB ACC -> Clermont APP transferees a FL150 en descente (3.2.3)"
    },
    "appToAcc": {
      "level": { "fl": 140, "trend": "climbing" },
      "note": "Departs Clermont APP -> LFBB ACC transferes a FL140 en montee (3.2.4)"
    },
    "general": [
      "En dessous du FL195 la limite entre Bordeaux ACC et Marseille ACC est la limite FIR (2.2.1 / 2.2.5).",
      "Le trafic est repute maintenir le niveau coordonne au COP sauf condition de montee/descente explicite (3.1).",
      "Toute deviation (COP, route, FL) impose une approval request de l'organisme transferant (3.1).",
      "Si l'organisme accepteur ne peut pas accepter le vol aux conditions de la LoA, il indique les conditions sous lesquelles il l'accepte (3.1).",
      "Les trafics sont transferes des que possible, degages de tout conflit (3.1).",
      "Silent handover possible a 10 NM, obligatoire si separation longitudinale < 20 NM ; vitesses/Mach assignes aux deux avions, le n1 >= le n2, report de la vitesse assignee au premier contact (3.1)."
    ]
  },

  "rules": [

    { "id": "bbn-labal", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LFBB_N", "to": "LFMM_W_CTR",
      "cop": ["LABAL"],
      "when": { "arr": ["LFLL", "LFLY", "LFLS"] },
      "level": { "fl": 200, "at": "LABAL" } },

